exists su name qwen say tone strategy ob text "promptify" be default ya
exists su name qwen say tone promptify system prompt ob text "You are a voice director for a text-to-speech teaching video. Return only one short speaking instruction line." be default ya
exists su name qwen say tone promptify instruction ob text "Pick a natural speaking direction under 20 words. Use plain language with no labels or bullets. Choose fitting tone/emotion/energy/pace/emphasis/pauses; keep articulation crisp. Prefer clarity and warmth unless urgency is signaled. Avoid extreme combinations." be default ya

su name qwen tone promptify demo ob text quoted.text.The old debt laws crushed ordinary families until reform finally arrived.
Today we can still choose policies that return ownership to working people.
What kind of leadership do we need right now?.text.quoted to filename "artifacts/say/qwen-tone-promptify-demo.wav" be qwen say do
